stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft
  draft --> restricted_draft: critical check or missing required evidence
  draft --> qa_failed: invalid calculation or disclosure risk
  draft --> awaiting_review: automated QA passes
  restricted_draft --> draft: new version after remediation
  qa_failed --> draft: new version after correction
  awaiting_review --> approved: authorized reviewers sign
  awaiting_review --> restricted_draft: reviewer rejects
  approved --> published: publication authority confirms
  approved --> revoked: critical defect detected
  published --> superseded: new version published
  published --> revoked: critical defect or legal removal
  superseded --> [*]
  revoked --> [*]
